      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="ESmy003"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">MY-003</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Maṣḥafa gǝbra ḥǝmāmāt “Book of the Rite of the Holy Week”</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex, 350×287×75 , 154 fols (7
                           p. blank [fols 1r, 1v, 2r, 2v, 3r, 154r, 154v] ), A + 19 quires , Probably between 1841 and 1852..</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e232LIT1544Gebrah">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 4ra–153rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Lectionary of the Holy Week’ (​ግብ​ረ፡ ​ሕማ​ማት፡), CAe 1544.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e238LIT1544Gebrah#Introduction">
               <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 4ra–6ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Introduction</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                          ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​፩አም ​ላክ፡
                          ​ንቀ​ድም፡ ​በረ​ድኤ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወበ​በረ​ድኤ​ተ፡ ​ወበ​ርድ​ኤተ፡ ​ሥም​ረቱ፨ ​ንጽ​ሕፍ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡
                           ​መጽሐ ​ፈ፡ ​ዘይ​ደሉ፡ ​አን​ብቦ​ታ፡ ​እም​ኦሪ​ት፡ ​ወእ​ምነ​ቢያ​ት፡ 
                           ​ወእ​መዝ​ሙራ​ተ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡ ​ወወ​ንጌ​ላት፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳት፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ይደ​ሉ፡ ​አን​ብቦ​ቱ፨
                           ​በበ​ጾታ​ሁ፡ ​በመ​ዋዕ​ለ፡ ​ሰሙ​ን፡ ​ክቡ​ር፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ሰሙ​ነ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሕ፨
                         </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e257LIT1544Gebrah#EvePalmSunday">
               <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 6ra–8rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Eve of Palm Sunday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">readings include Admonition of John Chrysostom
                           (fols 6rc–8rb)</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​፩አ​ምላ​ክ፡ 
                              ​ዘን​ቱ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፍ፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​በሰ​ንበ​ት፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ኆሣ​ዕና፡ ​ሰር​ክ፨  
                              ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘ፻​፳ወ​፩፡ ​ተፈ​ሣሕ​ኩ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ይቤ​ሉኒ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ነሐ​ውር፡ ​ወቆ​ማ፡ ​እግ​ሪነ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አዕ​ፃድ​ኪ፡
                              ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፨ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​ንጽ​ሕት፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፨  ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘማ​ቴዎ​ስ፡  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ሖረ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡
                              ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ሰዱ​ስ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ዘፋ​ሲካ፡ ​ሖረ፡ ​ቢታ​ንያ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​አል​አዛ​ር፡ ​ዘአ​ንሥ​ኦ፡
                             </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e285LIT1544Gebrah#PalmSundayGH">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 8rb–14rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Palm Sunday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                          ​በዝ​የ፡ ​ያን​ብቡ፡ ​ምዕ​ዳነ፡ ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ሆሣ​እና፡ ​በሰ​ንበ​ት፡ 
                          ​ነግ​ህ፡ ​ኦሪ​ት፡ ​ዘል​ደት፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ቀር​በ፡ ​መዋ​ዕሊ​ሁ፡ ​ለያ​ዕቆ​ብ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይፍ​ልስ፡ ​ጸው​ዖሙ፡ ​ለኵ​ሎሙ፡ ​ደቂ​ቁ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡
                          ​ተጋ​ብኡ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡ ​ኦው​ሉድ​የ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እን​ግር​ክሙ፡ ​በደ​ኃሪ፡ ​አዝ​ማን፨
                         </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e301LIT1544Gebrah#Monday">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 14rc–30rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Monday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e308LIT1544Gebrah#MondayNight">
               <fo:inline>III-1) Fols 14rc–16rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Monday Night Hours</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                             ​ዘሠ​ኑይ፡ ​በ፩​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​ዘሌ​ሊት፡ ​ዘሰ​ፎን​ያስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​እግ​ዚአብ ​ሔር፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሰፎ​ንያ​ስ፡
                             ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ኩስ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ጎል​ያድ፡ ​አሞ​ራዊ፡ ​ዘሴ​ጺቅ​ያ፡ ​በመ​ዋዕ​ለ፡ ​ዮስ​ያ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​አሞ​ጽ፡ ​ነጉ​ሡ፡ ​ይሁ​ዳ፨ ​ኃሊ​ቀ፡ ​የኃ​ልቁ፡ ​እም​ገጸ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e324LIT1544Gebrah#MondayDay">
               <fo:inline>III-2) Fols 16rc–30rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Monday Day Hours</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Readings include
                              Admonition of Sinoda for Monday morning, 1st day hour (fols 19rc–19va);
                              Homily by John Chrysostom for Monday morning, 1st hour (fols 19vc–20vc);
                              Homily by John Chrysostom on the fig-tree
                              for Monday morning, 1st hour (fols 20vc–24rb);
                              anonymous Homily of the 9th hour (fols 27vb–28vb); another Admonition of
                              Sinoda, for 11th day hour (fols 29vb–30ra)</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በጽ​ባሕ፡ ​ኦሪ​ት፡ ​ዘል​ደት፡ ​በቀ​ዳሚ፡ ​ገብ​ረ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ሰማ ​የ፡ ​ወም​ድረ፡ ​ኢኮ​ነት፡
                                ​ድሉ​ተ፡ ​ጸለ​ት፡ ​መል​እል​ተ፡ ​ቀላ​ይ፨ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ሰ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ይጼ  (fol. 16va)  ​ልል፡ ​መል​እል​ተ፡ ​ማይ፨
                                ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ለይ​ኩን፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡
                               </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e360LIT1544Gebrah#Tuesday">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 30rb–45rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Tuesday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e367LIT1544Gebrah#TuesdayNight">
               <fo:inline>IV-1) Fols 30rb–32va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Tuesday Night Hours</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                             ​በቀ​ዳሚ፡ ​ሰዓ​ተ፡ ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​ዘሠ​ሉስ፡ ​ዘዘ​ካር​ያስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡  ​በካ​ልእ፡ ​ዓመ​ተ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ቱ፡ ​ለዳ​ርዮ​ስ፡ ​በሳ​ምን፡
                             ​ወር​ኅ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ዘካ​ርያ​ስ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​በራ​ክዩ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ሐና፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e383LIT1544Gebrah#TuesdayDay">
               <fo:inline>IV-2) Fols 32va–45rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Tuesday Day Hours</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The readings include Admonition of Sinoda for 1st day hour
                              (fols 35ra–35rb); Explanation by an anonymous on the biblical text
                              for the 1st day hour (fols 36ra–36va); Admonition by an anonymous
                              for the 9th day hour (fols 42vb–43vb)</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                           ​በሰ​ሉስ፡ ​ጽባ​ሕ፡ ​ኦሪ​ት፡ ​ዘፃ​ዖት፡ ​ወበ​ሣል​ስ፡ ​ወር​ኅ፡ ​እምዘ ​ወፅ​ኡ፡
                           ​ደቂ​ቀ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡ ​እም​ድረ፡ ​ግብ​ጽ፡ ​በዝ፡ ​ዕሌ​ት፨ ​ወመ​ጽኡ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገዳ​ም፡ ​ዘሲ​ና፡ ​ወወ​ፅኡ፡ ​እም​ራፌ​ድ፡ ​ወበ​ጽሑ፡
                           ​ወስ​ተ፡ ​ገዳ​ም፡ ​ዘሲ​ና፡ ​ወኃ​ደሩ፡ ​ህየ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡ ​መን​ጸረ፡ ​ደብ​ር፨
                         </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e410LIT1544Gebrah#Wednesday">
               <fo:inline>V) Fols 45rc–57va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Wednesday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e417LIT1544Gebrah#WednesdayNight">
               <fo:inline>V-1) Fols 45rc–47rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Wednesday Night Hours</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Readings for the 1st, 3rd, 6th, 9th, 11th hours</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                           ​በቀ​ዳሚ​ት፡ ​ሰዓ​ተ፡ ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​ዘረ​ቡዕ፡ ​ዘሕ​ዝቅ​ኤል፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ወነ ​በበ​ኒ፡
                           ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወይ​ቤለ​ኒ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​እጓ​ለ፡ ​እመ​ሕያ​ው፨ ​ወና​ሁ፡ ​ኮኑ​ኒ፡ ​ድሙ​ራነ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ብር​ት፡ ​ወብ​ሩር፡ ​ወሐ​ፂን፡
                          </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e435LIT1544Gebrah#WednesdayDay">
               <fo:inline>V-2) Fols 47rc–57va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Wednesday Day Hours</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Readings include Admonition for morning 1st hour
                              (fols 50va–51rc); Admonition of John Chrysostom for 9th hour
                              (fols 55va–56rc); Admonition of Severianus of Gabala (here
                              <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ኤጲ​ስቆ​ጶስ፡ ​ሳዊ​ሮስ፡ ​ዘሃ​ገረ፡ ​ገሊ​ላ፡</fo:inline>) for 11th hour (fols 57ra–57rb)</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                        ​በረ​ቡዕ፡ ​ጽባ​ሕ፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​ኦሪ​ት፡ ​ዘጸ​ዓት፡ ​ወአ​ንሥ​አ፡  ​ትእ​ይን​ቱ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ውሉ​ደ፡
                        ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወው​ሉደ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡ ​እም​ገዳ​ም፡ ​ዘሲ​ና፡ ​ዘበ​ትእ​ይንቶ  (fol. 47va)  ​ሙ፡ ​በቃ​ለ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡
                        ​ወበ​ጽሑ፡ ​ራፌ​ድ፡ ​ወአ​ልቦ፡ ​ህየ፡ ​ማይ፡ ​ዘይ​ሰቲ፨
                       </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e466LIT1544Gebrah#Thursday">
               <fo:inline>VI) Fols 57va–76ara: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Thursday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e473LIT1544Gebrah#ThursdayNight">
               <fo:inline>VI-1) Fols 57va–59vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Thursday Night Hours</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Readings for the 1st, 3rd, 6th, 9th, 11th hours</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                           ​በ፩​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​ዘሌ​ሊት፡ ​ዘሐ​ሙስ፡ ​ዘሕ​ዝቅ​ኤል፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡   ​ወወ​ሰደ​ኒ፡ ​ዓፀ​ደ፡ ​ጸን​ፈ፡
                           ​ጽባ​ሐዌ፡ ​ዘቅ​ድመ፡ ​ኆኅ​ት፡ ​ሰሜ​ናዌ፡ ​ወና​ሁ፡ ​አስ​ኬዴ​ሬ፡ ​፭ኀ​በ፡ ​ኤጲ​ሊጹ፡ ​ወኀ​በ፡ ​ድዮ​ርዘ​ኒጦ​ስ፨
                           ​ኑኁ፡ ​፻በ​እመ​ት፡ ​ወዐ​ፀድ፡ ​ሰሜ​ናዌ፡
                          </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e491LIT1544Gebrah#ThursdayDay">
               <fo:inline>VI-2) Fols 59vb–76ara: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Thursday Day Hours</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Readings include
                              Admonition of John Chrysostom for morning 1st hour (fols 69ra–69rc)</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                           ​በጽ​ባሕ፡ ​ሐሙ​ስ፡ ​በ፩​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​ወያ​ርኅ​ዉ፡ ​ኆኅ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​መቅ​ደስ፡ ​ወያ​ልብ​ሱ፡ ​ታቦ​ተ፡ ወ ​መጽ​አ፡
                           ​አማ​ሌቅ፡ ​ወተ​ቃተ​ሉ፡ ​በራ​ፌድ፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ለኢ​ያሱ፡ ​ኅረ​ይ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ዕደ​ወ፡ ​ወዳ​እ፡ ​ወተ​አኃ​ዞ፡ ​ለአ​ማሌ​ቅ፡ ​ጌሠ​መ፨
                          </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e513LIT1544Gebrah#Friday">
               <fo:inline>VII) Fols 76ara–124ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Friday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e520LIT1544Gebrah#FridayNight">
               <fo:inline>VII-1) Fols 76ara–85ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Friday Night Hours</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Readings  include the Homily of John of Constantinople for the 9th hour
                              (fols 81rb–84rb)</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                             ​በ፩​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​ዘዓ​ርብ፡ ​ዘኢ​ሳዪ​ያስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​በረ​ከቱ፡ ት ​ኩን፡
                             ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline>...</fo:inline>፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ናሁ፡ ​አነ፡ ​እፌ​ኑ፡
                             ​አራ​ዊተ፡ ​ዘይ​ቀት​ል፡ ​ወአ​ልቦ፡   (fol. 76arb)  ፡ ​ዘየ​ኃድ​ገክ​ሙ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e545LIT1544Gebrah#FridayDay">
               <fo:inline>VII-2) Fols 85ra–124ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Friday Day Hours</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Readings include
                              Admonition of John Chrysostom for morning 1st hour (fols 91rb–91rc);
                              Admonition by an anonymous for morning 1st hour (fols 92vb–93rb);
                              Admonition by an anonymous for the 3rd hour (fols 98rb–98vc); Homily of
                              
                              Jacob of Sarugh for the 3rd hour, with no mention of <fo:inline id="d1e556PRS8386SalamaI">ʾabuna Salāmā</fo:inline>
                              
                              as translator at the end (fols 98vc–103vc); Admonition of
                              Athanasius for the 3rd hour (fols 103vc–104ra);
                              Admonition of Athanasius for the 11th hour (fols 116va–116vc).</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              ​በዓ​ርብ፡ ​ስቅ​ለት፡ ​ጽባ​ሕ፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​ኦሪ​ት፡ ​ዘዳ​ግም፡ 
                              ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ለደ​ቂቀ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፨ ​አሰ​ምዕ፡
                                ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​ሰማ​የ፡ ​ወም​ድረ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ጠፊ​አ፡ ​ትጠ​ፍኡ፡ ​በከ ​መ፡ ​አሕ​ዛብ፡
                               ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ደም​ሰሶ​ሙ፡ ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ገጽ​ክሙ፡
                             </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e584LIT1544Gebrah#SaturdayNight">
               <fo:inline>VIII) Fols 124ra–137vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Saturday Night Hours</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Readings  include Revelation of John
                           for the 6th hour (fols 126rc–136ra);
                           Mass
                           (fols 136rc–137rc).</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                             ​በሰ​ንበ​ተ፡ ​አይ​ሁድ፡ ​ወበ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ትን​ሣኤ፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​ወት​ንሣ​ኤ፡ ​እሙ​ታን፡ 
                             ​በሣ​ልስ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ወአ​ንሥ​አኒ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሁ፨ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ጰራ​ቅሊ​ጦስ፡ ​ዋሕ​ድ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​በህ​ላዌ​ሁ፡ ​ዘሠ​ረፀ፡
                              ​እም​አረ​ብ፡ ​ይት​ቄድ​ስ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e613LIT1544Gebrah#Mass">
               <fo:inline>IX) Fols 137vc–144vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Lectionary of the Holy Week: Mass</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">including
                              Doctrina arcanorum for the 6th hour (fols 142vb–144ra)</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              ​ወአ​መ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ሌሊ​ተ፡ ​ያን​ብቡ፡ ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘዮ​ሐን​ስ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ተ ​ፍጻ​ሜቱ፡ ​ወይ​በሉ፡
                              ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ዘተ​ወል​ደ፡ እ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                              ​እም​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ተሣ​ሃለ​ነ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፨ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡
                              ​ተጠ​ምቀ፡ ​በዮ​ርዳ​ኖስ፡
                              </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e640LIT5808Selatat">
               <fo:inline>X) Fols 144vb–145va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Petitions in the Passion Week’ (​ስእ​ለታ​ት፡ ​በሰ​ሙነ፡ ​ሕማ​ማት፡), CAe 5808.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                           ​ወይ​ብል፡ ​ካህ​ን፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ሥዕ​ለታ ​ተ፡ ​በሰ​ሙነ፡
                           ​ሕማ​ማት፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወያ​ውሥ​ኡ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሉ፡ ​ተሣ​ሃለ​ነ፨ ​ጸል​ዩ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​መካ​ን፡ ​ወኵ​ሎን፡ ​መካ​ናት፡
                           ​እን​ተ፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ለአ​ባዊ​ነ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፨
                           </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e657LIT1750LahaMa">
               <fo:inline>XI) Fols 145vb–153rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Lamentation of Mary’ (​ላሐ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡), CAe 1750.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ድር​ሳን፡ ​፩አ​ምላ​ክ፡ 
                              ​ድር​ሳን፡ ​ዘደ​ረሰ፡ ​አባ፡ ​ሕር​ያቆ​ስ፡ ​ኤጲ​ስ፡ ​ቆጶ​ስ፡ ​ዘብ​ሕን​ሳ፨
                               ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ክብ​ራ፡ ​ለወ​ንጽ​ሕት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                ​ብካ​ያ፡ ​ወላ​ሃ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ስቅ​ለተ፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​መቃ​ብሩ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ሖረ​ት፨
                                 ​ወረ​ከበ​ት፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ትን​ሣኤ​ሁ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ተን​ሥአ፡ ​እሙ​ታን፡ ​በሰ​ላመ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አብ፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 3v: Ownership or donation note, partly effaced,
                             written in the main Hand 1. Personal names are not readable.
                           A half of the note is enclosed in a double thin line frame. Two black lines are drawn
                         below the note.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                           <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡
                              <fo:inline>[​ወዘ​ፈሐ]</fo:inline>​ቆ፡ ​ውጉ​ዘ፡
                              ​ለይ​ኩን። ​አን​ትሙ​ሂ፡ ​ካህ​ናት፡ ​ኢታ​ንት​ጉ፡ ​ጸል​ዮ፡ ​ለለ​ተስ​እል​ክም​ዎ፡
                              ​ለሊ​ቅክ​ሙ፡ ​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ይት​ነበ​ብ፡ ​፯ጊ​ዜያ​ተ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ሊቅ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​ምስ​ለክሙ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>። </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 153va–153vb: Written in the same recent
                             secondary hand as <fo:inline/>,
                             very similar to that note in wording and orthography.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              ​ዝመ​ጽሐ​ፍ፡ ​ግብ​ረ፡ ​ህማ​ማት፡ ዘ<fo:inline id="d1e1135PRS8668SebhatA">​ራስ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡</fo:inline>
                              ​ዘወ​ሐቦ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e1138INS0039MY">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​ደብ​ረ፡ ​ማዕ​ፆ፡</fo:inline>
                               ​ከመ፡ ​ይኵ​ኖ፡ ​መር​ሐ፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ወስ​መ፡ ​ክር​ስት​ናሁ​ኒ፡
                              ​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወሰ​መ፡ ​እሙ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e1141PRS13295WalattaSellase">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ሥላ​ሴ፡</fo:inline>​ወስ​መ፡
                              ​ብእ​ሲቱ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e1144PRS13296WalattaMaryam">
                            ​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ወስ​መ፡ ​ደቂ​ቁ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e1147PRS13291GabraHeywat">​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline id="d1e1151PRS13292WaldaGabreel">​ወል​ደ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline id="d1e1154PRS13293ArayaSellase">
                           ​አር​አያ፡ ​ሥላ​ሴ፡</fo:inline> ​ኦአ​ምላ​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e1157PRS5741Johnthe">​ዮሐ​ንስ፡</fo:inline> ​ዕቀ​ብ፡ ​ሕይ​ወቶ፡ ​ወሥ​ረይ፡ ​ሐጢ​አቶ፡
                              ​ወአ​ግር​ር፡ ​ፀሮ፡ ​ወጸ​ላዕ​ቶ፡ ​ታሕ​ተ፡ ​እገ​ሪሁ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ ​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወለ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ቤ  (fol. 153vb)  ​ቱ፡
                              ​ይዕ​ቀቦ​ሙ፡ ​እመ​ከራ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ወነ​ፍስ፨ ​ለዝ​ንቱ​ኒ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፍ፡ ​ዘሠ​ረቆ፡ ​ወዘ​ፈሐ​ቆ፡ ​በስ​ልጣ​ነ፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡ ​ወጳ​ውሎ​ስ፡ ​ውጉ​ዘ፡ ​ለይ​ኩን፨</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 153vb–154r: Inventory of the books and church property
                             of <fo:inline id="d1e1173INS0039MY">Dabra Māʿṣo Yoḥannǝs</fo:inline>.
                            crudely written partly in pencil, partly in ball pen, in a
                           crude recent hand. The purpose was possibly the transfer of the church property
                            from one keeper to another. Many words are poorly readable. The last four lines of the note are
                           placed on fol. 154r</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                             ​አሳ​ላፊ፡ ​ብስ​ራት፡ <fo:inline>ሲቀበሎ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>፪ወንጌን፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​፩ቅ​ዳሴ፡ ​፩ግ​ብረ፡ ​ህማ​ማት፡ ፩<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                             ​ወር​ቅ፡ ​፪ገ​ድለ፡ ​ዮሐ​ን፡ ​፩ተ​አም​ረ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ተአ​ምረ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​፩፩​አስ​ልጢ፡
                             ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ጥም​ቀት፡ ​፩፩​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ሰ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡
                              ​፩ጸ​ሎተ፡ ​እጣ​ን፡ ​ትል​ቅ፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡   (fol. 153vc)  ​ቀሪ፡ ​ገድ​ለ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​ሰባ​ራ፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡
                              <fo:inline>፪ገድረ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​ገድ​ለ፡ ​ጻድ​ቃን፡ ​፩ግ​ንዘ​ት፡<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                               ​፩ዜ​ና፡ ​ስላ​ሴ፡ ​፪ቅ​ዳሴ  (fol. 154ra)   ​መጽ​ሀፍ፡
                               ፯<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                               ​ልብ​ሲ፡ ፲<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡ ​ጸላ​ል፡ ​አሰ​ርቱ፡
                               ​ሳንደ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡ ​ክል​እ፡</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 3rv, 153vb: Stamp of <fo:inline id="d1e1218PRS8668SebhatA">rās
                          Sǝbḥāt ʾAragāwi</fo:inline> (the first one under a1).</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 1v: Small unclear note in pen.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                      The names of the individuals (donors?) mentioned in the supplication
                           formulas seem to have been added by a red ink (vermilion) different from the
                           other rubrications, though the hand appears the same.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The space for the names of the commissioners is left blank in supplication formulas on
                            many folia, e.g. fol. 57ra, , fol. 60va, , fol. 69ra, , fol. 71vb, ,
                           fol. 76ra, , fol. 29vb, , fol. 96vc, ,
                           fol. 116va.
                         </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>Two wooden boards covered with reddish-brown tooled
                           leather. Two pairs of sewing stations.
                        One pair of chains of endband stitches at
                           the spine cover, close to the head of the codex.Blind tooled ornament on the reddish-brown leather
                           cover (at least 8 tools were used: criss-cross, triple sine wave, triple
                           line fillet, double circle, cross hatching, x-form, double crescent with
                           eye, small x).</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Foliation by Ethio-SPaRE,
                          in pencil, in the outer corner of the bottom margin.
                          Number 76 has been used twice
                          (the pictures are numbered 76 and
                          76a). </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block>20 quires. A<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">2+1 (Fols 1r–3v)</fo:inline> – I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 4r–11v)</fo:inline> – II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 12r–19v)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 20r–27v)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 28r–35v)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 36r–43v)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 44r–51v)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 52r–59v)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 60r–67v)</fo:inline> – IX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6+2 (Fols 68r–75v)</fo:inline> – X<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 76r–82v)</fo:inline> – XI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6+2 (Fols 83r–90v)</fo:inline> – XII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 91r–98v)</fo:inline> – XIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 99r–106v)</fo:inline> – XIV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 107r–114v)</fo:inline> – XV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 115r–122v)</fo:inline> – XVI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 123r–130v)</fo:inline> – XVII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 131r–138v)</fo:inline> – XVIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 139r–146v)</fo:inline> – XIX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 147r–154v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>3
                                    columns (33 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">All data are for fol. 107r. The
                             dimensions of the text area slightly alterate
                             through the manuscript (33-34 written lines).
                             13-14 characters per written line.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            260 × 230mm (fol. 107r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 30 , bottom: 60 , right: 37 , left: 20 , intercolumn: 12  (fol. 107r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>On many folia the number of ruled lines is 32 or 33. Pricking and ruling are visible. Primary pricks are visible. Ruling pricks are visible. Structural pricks are visible. The upper line is written above the ruling, but on some folia
                              below, e.g.  fols 107r–114v. The bottom line is written above the ruling, but on some folia
                              also below, e.g. fols 5v, 7v, 61v. 
                              Fols 71r–72v
                              have an additional ruled line in the upper margin. Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Fine, careful, somewhat irregular; by a well-trained scribe.
                          Broad, slightly right sloping script. Parallel downstrokes, tops slightly inclined.
                          Rounded and rectangular letter shapes.
                          The handwriting becomes less regular and somewhat rushed to the end of the text, with slight changes in letter
                           sizes, so that it cannot be excluded that more than one scribe participated
                           in writing (cp. Fol. 106v and fol. 107ra and fol. 107rb, ,
                           fol. 119vc, , fol. 120ra , ​et​c.​).
                           ​Le​tt​ers መ ​and ጥ ​ha​ve ​re​ce​nt ​sh​ap​es.
                          ​He​avy ​6t​h-​or​der ​ma​rk​er ​of ​the ​si​gn ​ግ.
                          ​The ​4t​h-​or​der ​ma​rk​er ​of ቃ ​is ​sh​or​t, ​di​ag​on​al ​(e​.g.  fol. 150vb l.6, fol. 151rb l.9).
                          <fo:inline>Nineteenth-century script.</fo:inline>
                           <fo:block>Ink: Black, red, vermillion (for the names of donors in the
                            supplication formulas) and occasionally pink (e.g. fol. 48r).</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: Divine names; name of the donors;
                           names of <fo:inline id="d1e978PRS11721PeterVIIAlex">Patriach Peter (VII)</fo:inline> and
                           <fo:inline id="d1e981PRS8388SalamaI">Metropolitan
                           ʾabbā Salāmā</fo:inline> (fol. 145ra); six lines in
                            the incipit page of ms_i1.1
                            in three groups, alternating with
                            black lines; incipits of the texts, their sections and subsections; six
                            lines in the incipit page of the section
                            ms_i1.8.2, in
                            three groups, alternating with black lines. Titles of the Biblical
                            books and other works; names of the Hebrew letters
                            in ms_i1.8.2 (fols 117rc–117vc);
                            abbreviations; some selected words like
                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይቤ፡</fo:inline> in ms_i1.4 (esp.
                            fols 17vb–18rc) and ms_i1.6
                            (esp. fols 53vc–54ra);
                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸልዩ</fo:inline> (in ms_i1.11),
                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይተ​ርጕ​ም፡</fo:inline>,
                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መተ​ርጐ​ም፡</fo:inline> etc. Elements of the
                            punctuation signs; Ethiopic numerals or their elements; elements of the
                            text dividers.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Abbreviations: <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="6mm"
                                             provisional-label-separation="6mm"
                                             start-indent="cm">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>1)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                              ​ይዲ፡ or ​ይ፡ ​ዲ፡ for ​ይብ​ል፡ ​ዲያ​ቆን፡ (e.g. fol. 72vb l.10,
                              fol. 73rc, l.26)</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>2)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                              ​ይካ፡ or ​ይ፡ ​ካ፡ for ​ይብ​ል፡ ​ካህ​ን፡ (e.g. fol. 72vb l.12, fol. 73rc l.28)</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>3)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                              ​ስ፨ ​ይ፡ for ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፨ ​ይባ​ርክ​ዎ፡  (esp. Fols 120ra, 120rb)</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>4)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                              ​አሜ፡ for ​አሜ​አ፡  (esp. Fol. 59vc l.32)</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 2:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}--></fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good. The spine cover is slightly damaged. Cuts
                           carefully amended on fols 42, 57, 90, 109, 131, 147, 154. Small stains on fols 66r, 105r, 111r, 124r and some other folia. The upper part of the text on
                           fols 141v–143v are slightly affected by humidity.
                           Fols 28, 31, 106, 116 are of slightly irregular shape.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>Probably between 1841 and 1852.</fo:inline>
               <fo:inline id="d1e1293PRS11721PeterVIIAlex">Patriach Peter (VII)</fo:inline> of the Coptic Church
                     (in tenure 1809-52)
                     is mentioned on 145ra, and <fo:inline id="d1e1300PRS8388SalamaI">Metropolitan

                     ʾabbā Salāmā</fo:inline> (in tenure <fo:inline>1841–1867</fo:inline>) on 114ra and 145ra.

                     Names of individuals who were probably original commissioners are mentioned
                     in some supplication formulas,
                      <fo:inline id="d1e1310PRS13323GabraSellase">Gabra Śǝllāse</fo:inline> (fols 6ra, 6rb, 136ra, 150rc) and

                     <fo:inline id="d1e1315PRS13327WaldaMaryam">Walda Māryām</fo:inline> (fols 24rb, 91rb, 144vb).
                  </fo:block>
            <fo:block>
                    According to Addition 1, the manuscript was

                    donated to <fo:inline id="d1e1327INS0039MY">Dabra Māʿṣo Qǝddus Yoḥannǝs</fo:inline> by <fo:inline id="d1e1329PRS8668SebhatA">rās Sǝbḥāt
                    (ʾAragāwi)</fo:inline> (b. ca. 1844, d. 1914), with
                     baptismal name Kidāna Māryām. The names of his relatives are also
                     mentioned, such as his mother <fo:inline id="d1e1334PRS13295WalattaSellase">Walatta Śǝllāse</fo:inline>,
                     his wife <fo:inline id="d1e1338PRS13296WalattaMaryam">Walatta Māryām</fo:inline>, his children
                     <fo:inline id="d1e1341PRS13291GabraHeywat">Gabra Ḥǝywat</fo:inline>,
                     <fo:inline id="d1e1344PRS13292WaldaGabreel">Walda Gabrǝʾel</fo:inline>,
                     <fo:inline id="d1e1347PRS13293ArayaSellase">ʾArʾāyā Śǝllāse</fo:inline>.
                     <fo:inline id="d1e1350PRS8668SebhatA">Sǝbḥāt ʾAragāwi</fo:inline>, the governor
                    of <fo:inline id="d1e1353LOC1236Agama">ʿAgama</fo:inline>,
                     was elevated to the rank of <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">rās</fo:inline> by <fo:inline id="d1e1360PRS6668Mangasa">Mangašā Yoḥannǝs</fo:inline>
                      in 1892.
                      </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Bibliography</fo:block>DomLib/Ethio-SPARE Manuscript Cataloguing Database 2009.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESmy003">https://betamasaheft.eu/ESmy003</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
